WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
Let's connect your Facebook and Instagram leads to Wedding Yantra.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.939
It's easy.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:09.569
Before you start, you need a Facebook Page for your business.

00:00:09.569 --> 00:00:12.727
Not your personal profile.

00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:17.264
You must be an admin of that Page, with full control.

00:00:17.264 --> 00:00:19.944
And you need a lead form on Facebook.

00:00:19.944 --> 00:00:23.184
Facebook calls it an Instant Form.

00:00:23.184 --> 00:00:24.584
Now open Wedding Yantra.

00:00:24.584 --> 00:00:27.302
Go to Leads, and tap Connect now.

00:00:27.302 --> 00:00:31.782
Tap the orange button: Continue with Facebook.

00:00:31.954 --> 00:00:36.302
Facebook opens. Log in, and tap Continue as your name.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.252
Tick your business Page.

00:00:38.252 --> 00:00:41.982
Keep every switch on, and tap Save.

00:00:42.821 --> 00:00:45.391
You come back to Wedding Yantra.

00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:48.543
Tick your Page, and tap Switch on.

00:00:48.543 --> 00:00:53.233
When it says Receiving leads, you're connected.

00:00:53.768 --> 00:00:57.348
Each new lead goes to the salesperson with the fewest open leads.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:00.269
They get an alert on their phone.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:01.919
Now let's test it.

00:01:01.919 --> 00:01:04.809
Tap Send a test lead.

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:07.761
Test lead received.

00:01:07.761 --> 00:01:10.041
It works!

00:01:11.213 --> 00:01:12.323
That's it.

00:01:12.323 --> 00:01:17.804
New leads from your ads now come into Wedding Yantra by themselves, with an alert.

00:01:17.804 --> 00:01:19.174
Need help?

00:01:19.174 --> 00:01:21.254
Open Leads, and tap See how.

00:01:21.254 --> 00:01:24.800
Every step is there, with pictures.
